{
  "ledger": [
    "Market aisle - linear corridor with red awnings overhead, left stalls with hanging mesh bags/bulb lights and bins of green limes, red tomatoes, oranges/yellows, right stalls with crates/blue bins of green and red apples extending to vanishing point | same linear corridor geometry at end | camera tracks backward then arcs smoothly left-around subject, revealing continuous stall progression without rearrangement",
    "Left stall array - fixed row under red canopy: foreground green limes in dark green bin, red tomatoes, blue-wrapped produce, red crate of orange/yellow citrus, purple trays with green/blue fruits | retains left-side position relative to aisle | perspective slides with camera orbit, nearer bins/crates correctly occlude farther bins, hanging lights maintain parallax",
    "Right stall array - fixed row under red/blue canopies: wooden crates and blue plastic bins with red/green apples and other produce | retains right-side position relative to aisle | remains on observer right until orbit completes, then appears behind/left as viewpoint rotates  ~90-180 deg, consistent with circular camera path",
    "Blue umbrella + central woman (moving foreground occluder) - umbrella centered ~0.5m above woman's head, woman at aisle center holding red apple at chest height, walking toward camera | umbrella remains centered above head, woman rotates from front-facing to right-profile to back-facing as camera orbits | umbrella consistently occludes background awnings/lights, woman correctly occludes distant pedestrians and stalls when they are behind her plane",
    "Background connectivity / depth ordering - open aisle with no doors/windows, depth recedes linearly with pedestrians and stall rows scaling with distance | same open connectivity at end with deeper stalls visible ahead of woman | distant figures remain smaller and are occluded by nearer people/stall edges; occlusion edges evolve smoothly with no background-through-foreground rendering"
  ],
  "findings": []
}
